---
title: "interest_accrual - Trilinear Interest Rate Model (Scallop Lending)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_time: read clock timestamp
    q_get_time --> q_calc_elapsed: elapsed = current_time - last_update_time
    q_calc_elapsed --> q_check_elapsed: elapsed > 0
    q_check_elapsed --> q_calc_utilization: time has passed since last update
    q_check_elapsed --> [*]: no time elapsed, skip

    q_calc_utilization --> q_phase1: utilization = total_borrows / (total_supply + total_borrows)

    q_phase1 --> q_apply_rate1: utilization <= kink1
    q_phase1 --> q_phase2: utilization > kink1

    q_apply_rate1 --> q_calc_borrow_rate: borrow_rate = base_rate + utilization * multiplier1

    q_phase2 --> q_apply_rate2: utilization <= kink2
    q_phase2 --> q_phase3: utilization > kink2

    q_apply_rate2 --> q_calc_borrow_rate: borrow_rate = rate_at_kink1 + (utilization - kink1) * multiplier2

    q_phase3 --> q_apply_rate3: utilization > kink2
    q_apply_rate3 --> q_calc_borrow_rate: borrow_rate = rate_at_kink2 + (utilization - kink2) * multiplier3

    q_calc_borrow_rate --> q_calc_supply_rate: supply_rate = borrow_rate * utilization * (1 - reserve_factor)
    q_calc_supply_rate --> q_compound: interest_accumulated = total_borrows * borrow_rate * elapsed

    q_compound --> q_update_borrows: total_borrows += interest_accumulated
    q_update_borrows --> q_update_reserve: reserve += interest_accumulated * reserve_factor
    q_update_reserve --> q_update_exchange: exchange_rate = (total_supply + total_borrows - reserve) / total_market_coin
    q_update_exchange --> q_update_timestamp: last_update_time = current_time
    q_update_timestamp --> [*]: interest accrued

    note right of q_calc_utilization
        INV-001: 0 <= utilization <= 1
        INV-002: trilinear model has 3 phases with increasing slopes (multiplier3 > multiplier2 > multiplier1)
    end note

    note right of q_calc_borrow_rate
        INV-003: borrow_rate is monotonically increasing with utilization
        INV-004: at high utilization (near kink2), steep rate incentivizes repayment
    end note

    note right of q_update_exchange
        INV-005: exchange_rate is monotonically increasing over time (never decreases)
        INV-006: sCoin value always appreciates relative to underlying asset
        INV-007: reserve_factor portion of interest goes to protocol, not suppliers
    end note
